as.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vc4EHpEfjDFrjUolC5sJu3wN5z.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-14\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Marsh of Mystery\",\"overview\":\"Makini chases mysterious blue lights!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7q2Pofl4hfKYCdqzLng1ZFhOSzn.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-15\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Dragon Island\",\"overview\":\"The Lion Guard encounters Komodo Dragons!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/acfrS2d0WZT9aHKlr8tzJDHdbGE.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-21\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Journey of Memories\",\"overview\":\"When Makini's memories of her first journey to the Tree of Life result in getting the Guard lost in the desert, they must learn to travel by night and navigate by the stars.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5sV3apiuNfZ8Si5o9CESdDDk9JE.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-22\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"The Race to Tuliza\",\"overview\":\"Fuli gets lost and is forced to race a male cheetah.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iPFUZASwCqBkJrmB29VrVreRrpa.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-28\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Mama Binturong\",\"overview\":\"The Guard searches for Makini's stolen staff.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7Y41lhVfr0Ja8Ggyblj7XrwSRUj.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-29\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Friends to the End\",\"overview\":\"Ever closer to the Tree of Life, Kion's scar bothers him more than ever, causing Bunga to think that the venom in Kion's body is turning him evil.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9o0N21ATl09puXSJHQQsMFYWcVw.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2019-10-05\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"The Tree of Life\",\"overview\":\"The Lion 